  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria-Iraq 2022-2025. UNDP Security Sector Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through UNDP Denmark supports Iraqi security and justice sector institutions to improve safety and security for the people of Iraq. The aim is to strengthen the Government of Iraq&#x2019;s ability to maintain security through technical advice and assistance on a national and provincial level.</narrative>
  </description>
