  <result type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Strategic advisory, coordination and capacity development support provided to strengthen security sector governance.</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="275796" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1	Types of technical advisory support provided by UNDP to the Government of Iraq on the Security Sector Reform Process; disaggregated by the support to ONSA, PMO, SDC and MoI.
               

   
Climate Security Strategic Paper developed</narrative>
    </title>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2024-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2024-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="1"></target>
     <actual value="1"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="1.1 ONSA: N/A + PMO: 3 High Committee and Joint Technical Planning meetings held + SDC: N/A + MOI: N/A"></target>
     <actual value="1.1 No target was set in 2022 due to the delayed formation of the Government.  

b)  
No meetings were held.
Original overall target was surpassed in 2023, hence, no specific targets were set for 2024-25. No targets were set for 2025 due to the scheduled national parliamentary election.

c) The Iraq SSR partnership (ISSRP) related targets were replaced with the objective of supporting and capacitating the Parliamentary Security and Defence Committee (SDC). No targets were set for 2025 due to the preparation for the upcoming parliamentary election. The indicator was slightly rephrased to incorporate support provided to the SDC."></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-31"></period-end>
